  "summary": {
    "text": "DeepSeekMoE 16B is an open-weights mixture-of-experts language model from DeepSeek with 16.4B total and about 2.8B activated parameters, released as a Base and a Chat checkpoint with the DeepSeekMoE research paper. Its architecture combines fine-grained expert segmentation with shared experts that are always active.",
